<div class="production-page"><% const a=agreement,b=a.billing,amount=n=>helpers.money(Number(n),a.currency); %><h1>Review recurring billing · <%= a.agreement_number %></h1><p>StockChief paused before posting the affected invoice. Earlier invoices remain unchanged.</p><section class="section"><h2>Current full-period calculation</h2><p>Agreed fee <%= amount(review.amountMinor) %> · discount <%= amount(review.discountMinor) %> · tax <%= amount(review.taxMinor) %> · total <strong><%= amount(review.totalMinor) %></strong></p><p>Original limits remain <%= b.max_periods %> periods and <%= amount(b.max_total_minor) %> including tax. Already billed <%= amount(b.billed_total_minor) %>.</p><p>Reason for review: <%= b.last_error %></p><p>If the accounting period is closed, resolve it through Money before retrying. This approval does not change invoice dates or reopen a period.</p><form method="post" action="/custody/<%= a.id %>/review_recurring" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="requestKey" value="<%= formKey %>:review-billing"><input type="hidden" name="expectedRevision" value="<%= b.revision %>"><input type="hidden" name="pricingBasisHash" value="<%= review.integrityHash %>"><button class="btn">Authorize these terms within the original limits</button></form><a href="/custody/<%= a.id %>#rental-billing">Back to agreement</a></section></div>
